parts:
对$\begin{pmatrix}\bm{I}+\bm{A}&\bm{O}\\\bm{O}&\bm{I}-\bm{A}\end{pmatrix}$施行块初等变换, 证明
    \[
      \begin{aligned}
        &\operatorname{rank}(\bm{I}+\bm{A})+\operatorname{rank}(\bm{I}-\bm{A})\\
        &\quad=n+\operatorname{rank}(\bm{I}-\bm{A}^2);
      \end{aligned}
    \]

设$\bm{P}\bm{A}\bm{Q}$与$\bm{R}\bm{B}\bm{S}$分别是$\bm{A},\bm{B}$的相抵标准形, 其中$\bm{P},\bm{Q},\bm{R},\bm{S}$可逆. 证明$\bm{X}\mapsto\bm{Q}^{-1}\bm{X}\bm{R}^{-1}$是这个方程组的解空间到方程组
    \[
      \begin{pmatrix}\bm{I}_r&\bm{O}\\\bm{O}&\bm{O}\end{pmatrix}\bm{Y}\begin{pmatrix}\bm{I}_s&\bm{O}\\\bm{O}&\bm{O}\end{pmatrix}=\bm{O}
    \]
    的解空间的同构映射;

