parts:
将$\bm{M}$对角化, 证明
    \[
      \begin{aligned}
        x_k&=\frac{(3+2\sqrt2)^k+(3-2\sqrt2)^k}2,\\
        y_k&=\frac{(3+2\sqrt2)^k-(3-2\sqrt2)^k}{2\sqrt2};
      \end{aligned}
    \]

设$\bm{H}$是$n$阶Hadamard矩阵, 证明
    \[
      \begin{pmatrix}\bm{H}&\bm{H}\\\bm{H}&-\bm{H}\end{pmatrix}
    \]
    是$2n$阶Hadamard矩阵;

证明Lorentz变换
    \[
      \bm{L}_\varphi=\begin{pmatrix}\cosh\varphi&\sinh\varphi\\\sinh\varphi&\cosh\varphi\end{pmatrix}
    \]
    满足$\bm{L}_\varphi^\top\bm{N}\bm{L}_\varphi=\bm{N}$, 且$\bm{L}_\varphi\bm{L}_\psi=\bm{L}_{\varphi+\psi}$;

证明$\alpha_k=\frac{\boldsymbol r_k^\top\boldsymbol r_k}{\boldsymbol r_k^\top\bm{A}\boldsymbol r_k}$, 且
    \[
      \begin{aligned}
        &E(\boldsymbol x_{k+1})\\
        &=\left(1-\frac{(\boldsymbol r_k^\top\boldsymbol r_k)^2}{(\boldsymbol r_k^\top\bm{A}\boldsymbol r_k)(\boldsymbol r_k^\top\bm{A}^{-1}\boldsymbol r_k)}\right)E(\boldsymbol x_k);
      \end{aligned}
    \]

记$s_0=x_0^2+y_0^2+z_0^2-R^2$. 证明过$P_0$的全部切线构成以$P_0$为顶点的锥面, 方程为
    \[
        \begin{aligned}
            &\left(x_0x+y_0y+z_0z-R^2\right)^2\\
            &\quad=s_0\left(x^2+y^2+z^2-R^2\right);
        \end{aligned}
    \]
